{"id":"666255","name":"溜鱼片","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/666255/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鲷鱼","amount":"2片"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"薄荷","amount":"1朵(点缀用)"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"将鲷鱼片洗净，控去水份。","img":"images/666255/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成片状。","img":"images/666255/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡蛋只用鸡蛋清部分。","img":"images/666255/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"魚片中加入少许料酒、盐抓匀、再洗净去腥。","img":"images/666255/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"然后再加入适量的料酒、盐、干淀粉抓匀。","img":"images/666255/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中水烧开转小火下入魚片氽熟。","img":"images/666255/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"捞入盘中。","img":"images/666255/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中放入适量的淀粉水，生抽、少许盐、香油烧开搅拌均匀。","img":"images/666255/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"浇入魚片上即可，魚片洁白肉丝质鲜嫩。","img":"images/666255/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}